{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"zai-org/CodeGeeX4","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74","id":2572556746,"node_id":"I_kwDOMRdAoc6ZVhnK","number":74,"title":"clion: CodeGeeX4 在远程开发模式下似乎表现异常 ","user":{"login":"Smalldy","id":14820063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODIwMDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14820063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy","html_url":"https://github.com/Smalldy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Smalldy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2024-10-08T08:57:01Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T11:42:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"CodeGeeX在远程模式下似乎表现异常，我需要时间详细解释：\r\n首先，远程开发分为主机和客户端，在两者都安装插件并启用的情况下，插件表现异常：\r\n1. IDE文件编辑窗口不再显示任何标签页，即使点击左侧项目文件浏览器中的文件，也不会发生任何事。\r\n2. CodeGeeX插件窗口空无一物\r\n\r\n此时，**需要卸载或禁用客户端的CodeGeeX插件，IDE才能正常使用。**\r\n另外： **仅安装客户端插件，会出现同样现象的故障**\r\n\r\n我怀疑插件作者并没有针对远程开发做专门的逻辑判断。使得用户在仅安装远程主机插件的情况下，才能正常运行IDE，并且，非远端项目自然也享受不到插件了（理所当然的，为了保证远程开发的正常，我们把它从客户端卸载/禁用了，否则就会出现上述故障）\r\n\r\n当我以为我能够正常使用时（仅启动单侧——主机侧插件），另一个问题出现了：\r\n\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97919949-c0fb-4a3c-bdd4-2326bc390f0e)\r\n是的，JCEF问题，到目前为止，我并没有解决这个问题。\r\n我当然进行过JAVA运行时切换，甚至按照提示给出的文档修改了注册表（远端、客户端都尝试过），这并没有起效。\r\n\r\n这就是我进行的全部尝试。很遗憾并未解决问题，希望问题可以得到注重。\r\n\r\n1. 提供良好的指引，正确的（或自动的）启动插件，或保证默认情况下（两侧都启动）插件正常\r\n2. 如何解决JCEF问题？\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/74/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}